    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "e5ff8d87-4b7f-3719-84c0-1706ef49b78d",
                "word": "alarmist",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f46d1d21-6b25-3826-9c52-4653f191be71",
                        "entry_id": "e5ff8d87-4b7f-3719-84c0-1706ef49b78d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Of or relating to causing others to become alarmed without cause."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "64c76fae-98ce-4ff2-9695-6d6044c09fe4",
                                "sense_id": "f46d1d21-6b25-3826-9c52-4653f191be71",
                                "text": "This deliberately alarmist scaremongery has since been repeated on various occasions, notably in Brazil before 1964 and in Chile under Allende."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9b8eeb72-6fed-4c1c-b6a1-c37e4327a94b",
                        "source_entry_id": "e5ff8d87-4b7f-3719-84c0-1706ef49b78d",
                        "source_sense_id": "f46d1d21-6b25-3826-9c52-4653f191be71",
                        "source_sense_description": "of or relating to causing others to become alarmed without cause",
                        "target_lang_word": "alarmistický",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "68003dce-0462-41b3-b6e1-c427db3733ab",
                        "source_entry_id": "e5ff8d87-4b7f-3719-84c0-1706ef49b78d",
                        "source_sense_id": "f46d1d21-6b25-3826-9c52-4653f191be71",
                        "source_sense_description": "of or relating to causing others to become alarmed without cause",
                        "target_lang_word": "alarmistyczny",
                        "target_lang_code": "pl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "alarmistyczny",
                                "target_lang_code": "pl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f83a1fa2-e8fc-3a40-bc22-412bf713a071",
                                        "entry_id": "caa80e3f-7913-3e1d-9652-ef7c5b8d6fd6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "wzbudzający niepokój przed niebezpieczeństwem, mający ostrzec przed czymś niepokojącym, co zasługuje na większą uwagę; często czymś, co wcale nie zasługuje na nią"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "511ed40d-8008-4226-902c-546b3b23e606",
                                                "sense_id": "f83a1fa2-e8fc-3a40-bc22-412bf713a071",
                                                "text": "Od kilku lat potężne media prowadzą alarmistyczne kampanie: w polskiej oświacie nie prowadzi się edukacji seksualnej, dla dobra naszej młodzieży należy ją jak najszybciej wprowadzić"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bbd8e450-8b09-49da-8a5e-e565b14a7ca6",
                                                "sense_id": "f83a1fa2-e8fc-3a40-bc22-412bf713a071",
                                                "text": "Skąd zatem te alarmistyczne doniesienia mediów o rosnących problemach z narkotykami, alkoholem i przemocą w szkołach?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6152743-762c-4aa5-85c7-402b96c0b0e7",
                                                "sense_id": "f83a1fa2-e8fc-3a40-bc22-412bf713a071",
                                                "text": "To stwierdzenie stało się źródłem alarmistycznych prognoz"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "e1c353fd-8896-3464-8e1d-34fdfa73133b",
                "word": "alarmist",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c1dc0326-b2b0-4dd2-aced-cbafa43465d4",
                        "entry_id": "e1c353fd-8896-3464-8e1d-34fdfa73133b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "alarmists"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "15a96bbd-c796-347b-9ac8-313745251987",
                        "entry_id": "e1c353fd-8896-3464-8e1d-34fdfa73133b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "One who causes others to become alarmed without cause."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ee2edc2-7224-4f0d-9c4a-eeca301d09b7",
                                "sense_id": "15a96bbd-c796-347b-9ac8-313745251987",
                                "text": "I don't mean to be an alarmist, but I do think you should prepare yourself for the worst."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "19804515-c64a-413d-8b1e-b765f98403f3",
                                "sense_id": "15a96bbd-c796-347b-9ac8-313745251987",
                                "text": "No German troops were mobilized along Canada's border last week, no Canadian cities had been bombed, and only by the remotest flight of fancy could alarmists see the Dominion as a battleground."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e5bb565c-2445-4bd2-b016-00a02206f67c",
                        "source_entry_id": "e1c353fd-8896-3464-8e1d-34fdfa73133b",
                        "source_sense_id": "15a96bbd-c796-347b-9ac8-313745251987",
                        "source_sense_description": "one who causes others to become alarmed without cause",
                        "target_lang_word": "alarmista",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "252efeda-330c-4585-b61b-0f854d815f63",
                        "source_entry_id": "e1c353fd-8896-3464-8e1d-34fdfa73133b",
                        "source_sense_id": "15a96bbd-c796-347b-9ac8-313745251987",
                        "source_sense_description": "one who causes others to become alarmed without cause",
                        "target_lang_word": "alarmiste",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "alarmiste",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ecdfba4a-9907-34c9-bbab-1bb2f29d973b",
                                        "entry_id": "6e21bcdb-d221-3be8-8f1a-27cf6646342e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui se plaît à répandre des bruits alarmants."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9013a22c-75eb-4163-9afa-bc95b1887ba4",
                                                "sense_id": "ecdfba4a-9907-34c9-bbab-1bb2f29d973b",
                                                "text": "Nul ne croyait au 30 juillet que la guerre fût proche, et lorsque quelqu'un se hasardait à faire part de ses inquiétudes, il était considéré comme un alarmiste, suspect pour le moins de jouer à la baisse."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b28a6fde-8e92-4565-9e96-fd62c673ff6d",
                                                "sense_id": "ecdfba4a-9907-34c9-bbab-1bb2f29d973b",
                                                "text": "Le carnage, sous la figure d'un géant, tenait une coupe de sang qu'il buvait à longs traits, et un glaive à deux tranchans, sur lequel étaient gravés ces mots: Guerre à mort aux aristocrates aux modérés, aux ci-devant nobles aux prétres, aux alarmistes aux indulgens au peuple qui parle et à celui qui se-tait."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
